205
00:12:16,937 --> 00:12:19,937
And that's pretty hard and
practically not even very realistic.

206
00:12:20,327 --> 00:12:25,037
But with eBPF, the user-mode programmer
goes to an eBPF programmer which he

207
00:12:25,037 --> 00:12:29,907
has or which he can maybe even be
himself, so it could even be simpler.

208
00:12:29,907 --> 00:12:33,117
And within a few days or hours, he
already has what he needs, and he

