00:20:51,637 --> 00:20:57,457
So JIT compiling, it compiles the
code from BBPF just in time at

358
00:20:57,457 --> 00:21:00,667
runtime as follows, and it goes
over the instructions one by one.

359
00:21:00,687 --> 00:21:05,207
And in our example, it reaches the
hypercall function or instruction and

